     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<div>for the packages that are part of RHadoop, rhbase, rhdfs and rmr2, please read and follow the install instruction on the project wiki. install.packages unfortunately won&#39;t do for a long list of reasons. The R version you have will do just fine.  For the other Hadoop-related packages, this group is not about them, so please ask on the appropriate forums. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Antonio</div></div>"
    ],
